atar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/227903?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joosua","html_url":"https://github.com/Joosua","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joosua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joosua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joosua/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joosua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joosua/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joosua/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joosua/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joosua/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joosua/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-02-05T13:35:41Z","updated_at":"2014-02-05T13:35:41Z","body":"Thank you so much for the fix.\n\nI did some testing and noted that this.currentTime wont get to reset when first animation loop is completed. This will trigger Animation.reset function call each time Animation.update is being called.\n\nI tracked possible issue from given code\n\n```\nif ( this.currentTime > duration ) {\n\n    this.reset();\n\n    if ( this.loop === false ) {\n\n        this.stop();\n\n    }\n\n}\n```\n\nand added a possible fix for the issue\n\n```\nif ( this.currentTime > duration ) {\n\n    this.currentTime = currentTime;\n    this.reset();\n\n    if ( this.loop === false ) {\n\n        this.stop();\n\n    }\n\n}\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/comments/34167983/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Joosua","id":227903,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzkwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/227903?v=4","gravatar_id":""